OL,4,G1800FThe Craig Charles Funk and Soul
OL,5,     FShow
OL,6,     GThis week's Trunk of Funk comes
OL,7,     Gfrom Cookin' On 3 Burners,
OL,8,     Gdelivering a 30-minute mix packed
OL,9,     Gwith deep funk, raw grooves and
OL,10,     Gheavy rhythm.
OL,11,G2100FDon Letts' Culture Clash Radio
OL,12,     GDon's Saturday night selections
OL,13,     Gcross time, space and genre.
OL,14,     GExpect tunes by the likes of The
OL,15,     GVerve, Hollie Cook, David Holmes,
OL,16,     GQueen Latifah, Jordan Rakei and
OL,17,     GOutkast.
